{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 4902,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have probably heard about the ten\nthousand dollar rule, the one that says"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4902,
    "dDurationMs": 3602,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your bank files a report the moment you\nmove that much cash."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9244,
    "dDurationMs": 4122,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And most people believe that if they\nsimply stay away from large piles of cash,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13686,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they stay invisible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15767,
    "dDurationMs": 2081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I need you to understand something today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18568,
    "dDurationMs": 1821,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cash is the least of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21289,
    "dDurationMs": 4902,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The truth is that almost every way you\nmove money now leaves a permanent paper"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26191,
    "dDurationMs": 4682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trail, and the IRS can see far more of it\nthan you would ever guess, without"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30873,
    "dDurationMs": 2801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a single dollar bill ever changing hands."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34835,
    "dDurationMs": 3381,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a record created the instant you\nsend a wire."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38717,
    "dDurationMs": 4662,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a separate report the moment you\nbuy a cashier's check, the very thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43379,
    "dDurationMs": 3141,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people reach for because it feels safer\nthan cash."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47100,
    "dDurationMs": 4762,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a form your own bank quietly\nmails to the government about you every"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51862,
    "dDurationMs": 2742,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "single year, and you never sign a thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55044,
    "dDurationMs": 5462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there is a silent comparison, run\nentirely by computer, that decides whether"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60506,
    "dDurationMs": 4202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an ordinary, honest retiree gets a letter\ndemanding money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65348,
    "dDurationMs": 3602,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "None of these involve cash. None of them\nare explained to you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69270,
    "dDurationMs": 4702,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the last one is the quiet trigger\nbehind more audits of decent people than"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73972,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all the others combined."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76193,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Stay with me all the way to the end,\nbecause I am going to show you exactly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80114,
    "dDurationMs": 5103,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where each line sits, and the simple habit\nthat keeps you clear of every one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85217,
    "dDurationMs": 4862,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of them. And here is the part I need you\nto hold onto before we start the first"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90079,
    "dDurationMs": 4562,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one, because it is the same truth running\nunderneath all of this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95161,
    "dDurationMs": 5022,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For the ordinary, honest retiree, none of\nthis paperwork is an accusation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100543,
    "dDurationMs": 1061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is routine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102324,
    "dDurationMs": 4922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It happens millions of times a day and\nalmost all of it goes absolutely nowhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107886,
    "dDurationMs": 4562,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What turns a harmless record into a real\nproblem is never the record itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112448,
    "dDurationMs": 5723,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is the one thing you forget to do, or\nthe one clever move you make to try"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118171,
    "dDurationMs": 3401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to stay hidden. So I am not here to\nfrighten you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122033,
    "dDurationMs": 5602,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am here to stand beside you and show you\nexactly where the line is, so that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127635,
    "dDurationMs": 2541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you never once cross it by accident."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130596,
    "dDurationMs": 5222,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first one is the wire transfer, and it\nis the perfect example of money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135818,
    "dDurationMs": 3322,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is watched closely without any cash\nat all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139580,
    "dDurationMs": 4582,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The moment you send a wire, whether it is\nto help a child with a down payment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144162,
    "dDurationMs": 5342,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on a house, to pay for a car, or simply to\nmove your own savings from one place"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149504,
    "dDurationMs": 581,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to another,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150825,
    "dDurationMs": 2521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your bank does not just quietly send the\nmoney."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153986,
    "dDurationMs": 5243,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It creates a permanent record of exactly\nwho you are, who received it, the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159229,
    "dDurationMs": 5502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "amount, and the date, and by law that\ninformation travels along with the money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164731,
    "dDurationMs": 4882,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from one bank to the next on any wire of\nthree thousand dollars or more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170173,
    "dDurationMs": 2481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That record is kept for years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172994,
    "dDurationMs": 3382,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For a normal transfer, nothing ever comes\nof it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176856,
    "dDurationMs": 5362,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if the wire is unusually large, or it\ngoes to a person or a place your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182218,
    "dDurationMs": 4602,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "account has never dealt with before, and\nespecially if it crosses the border"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186820,
    "dDurationMs": 5683,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into another country, it draws a closer\nlook, and the bank can file a separate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192503,
    "dDurationMs": 4122,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "report about it that you are never legally\nallowed to be told about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197145,
    "dDurationMs": 5122,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Picture a widow sending forty thousand\ndollars overseas to a new friend she"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202267,
    "dDurationMs": 4502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "met online, and you can see instantly why\nthe rule exists."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208350,
    "dDurationMs": 5162,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the very same system watches the\nhonest grandfather wiring money to his"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213512,
    "dDurationMs": 860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "grandson too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215313,
    "dDurationMs": 2381,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The lesson here is not to be afraid of\nwires."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218354,
    "dDurationMs": 3922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is to treat every large wire as\nsomething that leaves a clear footprint."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223216,
    "dDurationMs": 4762,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Know exactly what it is for, keep the\npaperwork that proves it, and never try"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227978,
    "dDurationMs": 4582,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to disguise the purpose, because the\ndisguise is the only thing that ever turns"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232560,
    "dDurationMs": 2761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a routine transfer into a real question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235782,
    "dDurationMs": 4241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second one catches the people who are\ntrying hardest to be careful, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240023,
    "dDurationMs": 2261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is exactly what makes it so unfair."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243185,
    "dDurationMs": 4041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A great many seniors, the moment they\nlearn about the ten thousand dollar cash"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247226,
    "dDurationMs": 4923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rule, decide they will simply use a\ncashier's check or a money order instead,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252149,
    "dDurationMs": 4481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "believing that a nice official bank check\nquietly slips under the radar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257051,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It does not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258831,
    "dDurationMs": 3702,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a completely separate rule that\nmost people have never heard of in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262533,
    "dDurationMs": 700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their lives."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264054,
    "dDurationMs": 4582,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Any time you walk in and use cash to buy a\ncashier's check, a money order,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268856,
    "dDurationMs": 4982,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or a traveler's check for three thousand\ndollars or more, the bank is required"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273838,
    "dDurationMs": 5482,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to write it down in a special log, with\nyour name and the details, and keep"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279320,
    "dDurationMs": 3582,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it on file. Three thousand dollars, not\nten."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283402,
    "dDurationMs": 3542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you thought you could get around\nthat by buying several smaller ones"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286944,
    "dDurationMs": 4642,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the same day that add up to more than\nthree thousand, the bank is required"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291586,
    "dDurationMs": 4061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to treat all of them as a single purchase\nand record it anyway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296448,
    "dDurationMs": 5022,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the very move that feels so much safer\nthan carrying cash actually trips"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301470,
    "dDurationMs": 4402,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a wire at a far lower number than the cash\nrule you were trying to avoid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307092,
    "dDurationMs": 4682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think of a careful man who sells a small\nboat for eight thousand dollars and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311774,
    "dDurationMs": 4762,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "does not want that much cash in his\npocket, so he takes a cashier's check and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316536,
    "dDurationMs": 2201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "walks it into his bank to deposit it\nsafely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319638,
    "dDurationMs": 3781,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He believes he has done the quiet,\nresponsible, invisible thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323899,
    "dDurationMs": 4582,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He has no idea that the purchase was\nwritten into a log with his name on it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328481,
    "dDurationMs": 4843,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the moment it was made. Nothing bad ever\nhappens to him, because the money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333324,
    "dDurationMs": 3141,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is clean and he kept the bill of sale from\nthe boat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337185,
    "dDurationMs": 5122,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But notice what happened. He was recorded\nat eight thousand dollars, using"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342307,
    "dDurationMs": 5383,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the exact method he chose to feel safe, at\na line that sits thousands of dollars"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347690,
    "dDurationMs": 3561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "below the cash rule he was so carefully\ntrying to avoid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352172,
    "dDurationMs": 3441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The honest way through this is simple and\nit protects you completely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356433,
    "dDurationMs": 4923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you genuinely need a cashier's check,\nbuy it, in one clean transaction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361356,
    "dDurationMs": 2261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and keep the receipt with your records."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364457,
    "dDurationMs": 4002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The only people who ever get hurt by this\nare the ones who deliberately break"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368459,
    "dDurationMs": 5102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the amount into little pieces to hide it,\nand breaking a sum into pieces to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373561,
    "dDurationMs": 3401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stay under a reporting line is not a\nclever trick."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377803,
    "dDurationMs": 5642,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is, by itself, a federal crime, even\nwhen every dollar of the money is completely"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383445,
    "dDurationMs": 460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "clean."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384646,
    "dDurationMs": 5602,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The third one is happening to you right\nnow, this very year, whether you have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390248,
    "dDurationMs": 5042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "noticed it or not, and with savings\naccounts finally paying real interest again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395290,
    "dDurationMs": 3182,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it matters more than it has in decades."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399392,
    "dDurationMs": 5062,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every year, your bank quietly adds up all\nthe interest it paid you, even if"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404454,
    "dDurationMs": 4982,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it comes to just a few dollars, and it\nsends a copy of that exact number straight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409436,
    "dDurationMs": 5663,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the IRS on a small form, at the very\nsame moment it mails a copy to you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415459,
    "dDurationMs": 3041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You did not sign anything. You did not\nagree to anything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418980,
    "dDurationMs": 5443,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It simply goes. Now here is the trap, and\nit is the easiest one in the entire"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424423,
    "dDurationMs": 3441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "world to fall into by pure, honest\nmistake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428344,
    "dDurationMs": 6423,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So many retirees have money spread across\nseveral places, an old savings account,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435307,
    "dDurationMs": 4722,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a certificate of deposit, a small credit\nunion account they nearly forgot they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440029,
    "dDurationMs": 5023,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "still had. When tax time comes, they\ncarefully report the interest from the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445052,
    "dDurationMs": 4021,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "accounts they remember, and they quietly\nleave off the one that slipped their"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449073,
    "dDurationMs": 5323,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mind. But the IRS already holds a copy of\nevery single one of those forms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455136,
    "dDurationMs": 3882,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A computer simply lines up what the banks\nreported against what you reported,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459398,
    "dDurationMs": 4582,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the instant there is a gap, a letter\ngoes out demanding the missing tax,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463980,
    "dDurationMs": 3481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "plus a penalty, plus interest piled on\ntop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467981,
    "dDurationMs": 4562,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Picture a widow who keeps most of her\nsavings at her main bank, but years ago"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472543,
    "dDurationMs": 5003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "opened a small certificate of deposit at a\ncredit union across town, and has"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477546,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "genuinely forgotten it exists."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 479927,
    "dDurationMs": 3501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This year it quietly earned her three\nhundred dollars in interest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483788,
    "dDurationMs": 5383,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She sits down, does her taxes with real\ncare, reports every account she can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489171,
    "dDurationMs": 3781,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "think of, and never once remembers that\nold certificate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493693,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Four months later the letter arrives."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496494,
    "dDurationMs": 2061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is not a person who is accusing her."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498855,
    "dDurationMs": 4742,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a cold machine that lined up one\nform she forgot against the return she"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503597,
    "dDurationMs": 5572,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "filed, and now it wants the tax on three\nhundred dollars, plus a penalty, plus"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509169,
    "dDurationMs": 4892,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "interest, and it has frightened her badly,\nall over an honest mistake that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514061,
    "dDurationMs": 3942,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a single afternoon of gathering her forms\nwould have prevented completely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518723,
    "dDurationMs": 4542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is one of the most common notices an\nhonest retiree will ever receive in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523265,
    "dDurationMs": 2801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the mail, and it is entirely avoidable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526747,
    "dDurationMs": 4642,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before you file, gather the interest form\nfrom every account you hold, every"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531389,
    "dDurationMs": 5602,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bank and every credit union, and report\nevery last one, even the tiniest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537251,
    "dDurationMs": 2822,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The machine is only ever looking for the\nmismatch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540333,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Give it nothing to find."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 542654,
    "dDurationMs": 4742,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the fourth one is the quiet trigger I\ntold you to wait for, the one sitting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547396,
    "dDurationMs": 5062,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "behind more audits of ordinary, honest\npeople than any of the others, because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 552458,
    "dDurationMs": 3061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it does not require you to do a single\nthing wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556480,
    "dDurationMs": 5002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The IRS quietly compares the total amount\nof money flowing into your bank"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561482,
    "dDurationMs": 3381,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "accounts against the income you reported\non your tax return."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 565824,
    "dDurationMs": 4041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If far more money lands in your accounts\nthan your reported income could ever"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 569865,
    "dDurationMs": 521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "explain,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571166,
    "dDurationMs": 4182,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that gap becomes one of the strongest\nreasons they pick a person for a much"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 575348,
    "dDurationMs": 780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "closer look."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576828,
    "dDurationMs": 4102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here is exactly why decent retirees\nwalk straight into it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581410,
    "dDurationMs": 2301,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The money is completely innocent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584292,
    "dDurationMs": 3881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is the twelve thousand dollars from\nselling your late husband's car."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 588633,
    "dDurationMs": 3602,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is the twenty thousand your daughter\nfinally paid back on a loan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592895,
    "dDurationMs": 4722,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is the inheritance from your sister,\nthe payout from an old life insurance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597617,
    "dDurationMs": 4742,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "policy, the savings you simply moved back\nin from an account you had closed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603000,
    "dDurationMs": 2521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not one dime of it is taxable income."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 606161,
    "dDurationMs": 4502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But to a computer that is only comparing\ntwo numbers, a large deposit that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610663,
    "dDurationMs": 3922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "does not match your income is simply a\nquestion waiting to be asked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 615165,
    "dDurationMs": 4462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you cannot answer that question\nclearly years later, that perfectly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 619627,
    "dDurationMs": 4202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "innocent deposit can end up costing you\nreal money and real fear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 624729,
    "dDurationMs": 4502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The protection is the very same one that\nruns through this entire video, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 629231,
    "dDurationMs": 2021,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it costs you absolutely nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631792,
    "dDurationMs": 4722,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whenever a large sum lands in your account\nthat is not your normal income,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 637254,
    "dDurationMs": 5303,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "write down in one plain sentence where it\ncame from, and keep whatever proves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642557,
    "dDurationMs": 5042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it, the bill of sale for the car, the note\nfrom your daughter, the letter from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 647599,
    "dDurationMs": 580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the estate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648979,
    "dDurationMs": 5163,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A single piece of paper, saved on the day\nthe money arrives, turns a terrifying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 654142,
    "dDurationMs": 3021,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "audit years later into a five minute\nanswer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 657683,
    "dDurationMs": 5062,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And before I give you the one simple habit\nthat answers all four of these,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 663286,
    "dDurationMs": 4942,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "let me take a worry off your shoulders,\nbecause fear makes people do foolish"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668228,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things with their own money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670569,
    "dDurationMs": 2721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your ordinary life is not being studied."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673830,
    "dDurationMs": 4762,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Social Security check landing in your\naccount every month is not a red"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678592,
    "dDurationMs": 6043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "flag. Buying your groceries, paying your\nutilities, slipping a hundred dollars"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684635,
    "dDurationMs": 4282,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to a grandchild for a birthday, none of\nthat is what any of this is about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 689737,
    "dDurationMs": 5022,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The entire system is built to notice the\nlarge and the unexplained, not the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694759,
    "dDurationMs": 5242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "small and the ordinary. So you do not need\nto shrink your life, or hide from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 700001,
    "dDurationMs": 4622,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your own bank, or start pulling your money\nout and stuffing it under a mattress,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 705204,
    "dDurationMs": 4081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is truly the single most dangerous\nthing a senior can do with their savings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710126,
    "dDurationMs": 4061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You only need to do the few small things I\nam about to give you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714428,
    "dDurationMs": 4722,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let me pull all four of these together,\nbecause there is one thread running"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 719150,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through every single one of them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 721271,
    "dDurationMs": 3401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The wire leaves a record. The cashier's\ncheck leaves a record."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 725092,
    "dDurationMs": 4002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The interest is reported to the government\nwithout your signature ever touching"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729094,
    "dDurationMs": 5042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it. And every large deposit is silently\nmeasured against the income you reported."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735056,
    "dDurationMs": 4502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not one of these needs cash, and not one\nof them is ever explained to you by"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 739558,
    "dDurationMs": 1781,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the bank or by the government."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742039,
    "dDurationMs": 5463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The whole system is built to watch quietly\nand to say nothing, and it is built"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 747502,
    "dDurationMs": 5082,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in such a way that the honest person who\nsimply forgot a form, or cannot explain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752584,
    "dDurationMs": 4942,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a deposit from years ago, can end up\nholding the exact same frightening letter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 757526,
    "dDurationMs": 3322,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as the person who was genuinely trying to\nhide something."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 761888,
    "dDurationMs": 4262,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you now know the difference, and the\ndifference is almost embarrassingly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766150,
    "dDurationMs": 4582,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "simple. Report every dollar of interest,\nfrom every account you own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 771272,
    "dDurationMs": 3662,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Keep a short, plain record of where every\nlarge deposit came from."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775454,
    "dDurationMs": 4402,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And never, ever break a payment into\nsmaller pieces to slip under a number,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 780356,
    "dDurationMs": 4342,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because that one act is the only thing\nhere that turns clean money into a crime."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 785438,
    "dDurationMs": 5102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do those three things, and every quiet\nreport the system files about you simply"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 790540,
    "dDurationMs": 5203,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "resolves itself and goes nowhere at all,\nexactly the way it was always meant"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 795743,
    "dDurationMs": 5302,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to. And to make all of this easy for you,\nI will put the official links below,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 801045,
    "dDurationMs": 5022,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "straight from the IRS, the plain pages on\nreporting your interest and on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 806067,
    "dDurationMs": 4962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "exactly what to do if one of these letters\never lands in your mailbox, so that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 811029,
    "dDurationMs": 2681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have them ready the moment you need\nthem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 813710,
    "dDurationMs": 2902,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So do one last thing before you go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 817192,
    "dDurationMs": 4802,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think of someone you love who is careful\nwith their money, a parent, a widow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821994,
    "dDurationMs": 4742,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or a widower, an old friend who keeps a\nlittle saved in more than one place"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 826736,
    "dDurationMs": 3141,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and still does their own taxes at the\nkitchen table."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 830618,
    "dDurationMs": 4361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The odds are very good that this year they\nwill forget the interest on one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 834979,
    "dDurationMs": 4883,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "small account, or deposit a check from\nselling something and never write down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 839862,
    "dDurationMs": 4662,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where it came from, and never once realize\nthey left a door standing open."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 844964,
    "dDurationMs": 5082,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Send them this. It costs you nothing, and\nit could spare them a frightening"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 850046,
    "dDurationMs": 3181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "letter over money they never owed a cent\nof tax on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 854008,
    "dDurationMs": 3521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the entire reason we sit down and\ndo this together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 858149,
    "dDurationMs": 4102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Keep your own records this week, report\nevery account when the time comes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 862751,
    "dDurationMs": 5183,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then let yourself rest easy, because a\npaper trail is only ever dangerous"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 867934,
    "dDurationMs": 2381,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the people who never knew it was there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870315,
    "dDurationMs": 200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now you know."
    } ]
  } ]
}
